## 2. Domain and logical target

g1=(1,0), g2=(1/2,sqrt(3)/2), Lambda=Z*g1+Z*g2.
For integer m>=4 use Lambda/m and the closed radius-one regular hexagon
with vertices R^j*g1, R the 60-degree rotation. Set
